UPDATE companies SET description='Wooden Hammer operates a woodworking shop in Monkton, Vermont, nestled in the state''s Champlain Valley. The company was founded in 2009 by Ben Raphael after he graduated cum laude from Colby College in Maine and apprenticed with two skilled carpenters. Raphael began building tree houses and forts from salvaged lumber as a child in Panton, Vermont, and translated that early hands-on experience into a professional cabinetry and furniture practice.

The shop produces custom cabinetry, fine furniture, and creative woodwork including kitchen cabinets, bathroom vanities, built-ins, and tables. The facility remains small by design, staffed by Raphael and one assistant, allowing direct communication between the craftsman and the client from initial contact through project completion. The company works with Vermont-sourced wood products as well as building materials sourced nationally, depending on client preference.

Testimonials reference projects for clients in Burlington, South Burlington, and Manhattan, New York. The business focuses on residential and light commercial projects where personalized design and craftsmanship are prioritized over volume production.

Raphael established the company to avoid assembly-line construction and bulk distribution, emphasizing sustainability and attention to detail. The firm''s differentiator is its scale: a two-person operation that delivers the highest level of care and personal service, with the actual maker involved at every stage.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Fine furniture making", "Built-in fabrication", "Kitchen cabinet fabrication", "Bathroom vanity fabrication", "Custom table making", "Carpentry", "Woodworking", "Design consultation"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Interior design", "Architecture", "Home renovation"], "materials": ["Vermont wood products", "Building materials (various sources)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Custom, low-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Small-by-design shop staffed by the founder and one assistant", "Direct craftsman-to-client communication throughout the project", "Works with Vermont-sourced and nationally sourced wood materials", "Sustainability-focused custom woodwork"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2009 by Ben Raphael -> /about-us", "Located in Monkton, Vermont (Champlain Valley) -> /, /about-us", "Makes custom cabinetry, fine furniture, built-ins, kitchen cabinets, bathroom vanities, tables -> /, /about-us", "Staffed by Ben Raphael and one assistant -> /about-us", "Serves homeowners, builders, designers, architects -> /", "Works with Vermont wood products and materials from far and wide -> /", "Ben Raphael graduated cum laude from Colby College, apprenticed with two carpenters -> /about-us", "Testimonials from clients in Burlington, South Burlington, Manhattan -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "we craft high-quality custom cabinetry and woodwork", "founded_year": "2009", "employee_count": "2", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='wooden-hammer' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Colfax, Wisconsin, Woods to Workshop LLC began when its founder, a hobby woodworker and engineer by trade, decided to build a timber-frame workshop and saw his own lumber. Recognizing that many quality logs were being wasted as firewood or left to rot, he started offering custom sawing services to others in the region.

The company provides mobile custom sawing within a 100-mile radius of Menomonie, Wisconsin, operating a band sawmill capable of plane (dimensional) sawing for construction-grade lumber and grade sawing to maximize high-quality, knot-free boards. Additional services include band saw blade sharpening and setting using a Wood Mizer CBN profile sharpener and dual tooth setter, chainsaw chain sharpening with an Oregon 520-120 grinder, and woodworking 3D modeling for concept evaluation and CNC routing.

Customers range from weekend hobbyists and serious enthusiasts to timber-frame builders and small-scale construction projects. The service area covers western Wisconsin, with the founder noting that clients trust him to maximize the value of their limited log resources for projects such as custom furniture, structural timbers, and specialty lumber.

The founder’s engineering background drives a focus on precision and detail, aiming to save customers time and money not only during sawing but throughout their subsequent projects. This commitment to maximizing log value and reducing waste is cited as the core reason the business was started.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plane (Dimensional) Sawing", "Grade Sawing", "Band Saw Blade Sharpening and Setting", "Chainsaw Chain Sharpening", "Woodworking 3D Modeling"], "industries": ["Woodworking", "Construction", "Timber framing", "Hobbyist/DIY"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Wood Mizer CBN profile sharpener", "Woodmizer Dual Tooth Setter", "Oregon 520-120 chainsaw grinder"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Engineer\u2019s attention to detail to save time and money across the project lifecycle", "Mobile sawing within 100+ miles of Menomonie, WI", "Focus on maximizing log value and reducing waste"], "facts_used": ["Company based in Colfax, Wisconsin -> db", "Founder is a hobby woodworker and engineer who built a timber-frame workshop -> /about-us", "Started custom sawing to prevent logs from being wasted as firewood or left to rot -> /about-us", "Provides custom sawing within 100+ miles of Menomonie, WI -> /", "Services: Plane (Dimensional) Sawing, Grade Sawing, Band Saw Blade Sharpening and Setting, Chainsaw Chain Sharpening, Woodworking 3D Modeling -> /services", "Equipment: Wood Mizer CBN profile sharpener, Woodmizer Dual Tooth Setter, Oregon 520-120 -> /services", "Targets weekend warriors, serious enthusiasts, timber frame builders -> /about-us and /", "Emphasis on maximizing log value, attention to detail, saving time and money -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Providing custom sawing within 100+ miles of Menomonie, WI.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "lan