UPDATE companies SET description='Workers LLC, operating as The Workers of Wisconsin, is based in Neenah, Wisconsin. The company was founded to serve the meat processing industry with reliability, expertise, and personal service.

The firm acts as a distributor and service provider for food processing and packaging equipment. The company also provides equipment service and repair, installation and setup, and stocks replacement parts to minimize downtime.

Its customers are primarily meat processors, butcher shops, and food production facilities that require portioning, vacuum sealing, stuffing, slicing, weighing, and labeling equipment. The Workers supports operations ranging from small butcheries to larger processing plants with both new machinery and ongoing maintenance.

