UPDATE companies SET description='York Metal Fabricators, Inc. was founded in 1963 by Leon and Evelyn York in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma. The company has remained a family-owned and operated business since its inception, focusing on custom ornamental railing fabrication.

The firm specializes in the non-ferrous handrail industry, offering a fully customized approach with no predetermined rail systems or parts. It works with a range of materials including aluminum, stainless steel, bronze, wood, and glass, building each project to meet the specific design intent. The company also collaborates with partners to provide complete metal packages.

York Metal Fabricators serves architects, designers, general contractors, and steel companies. Its client base includes architectural and design professionals seeking custom railing solutions, general contractors requiring direct coordination with the build team, and steel companies looking for a fabrication partner to deliver full metal packages.

The company emphasizes its commitment to quality and craftsmanship, citing numerous National Craftsmanship Awards from the National Ornamental & Miscellaneous Metals Association (NOMMA) Top Job Competition. Leadership includes two past presidents of NOMMA and a past chairman of the Standards Committee on Permanent Railing Systems, reflecting deep industry involvement.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom ornamental railing fabrication", "Non-ferrous handrail fabrication", "Full metal package collaboration"], "industries": ["Architects", "Designers", "General Contractors", "Steel Companies"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless Steel", "Bronze", "Wood", "Glass"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No set list of rail systems; every project built to the design", "Customized approach to non-ferrous handrail fabrication", "Multiple NOMMA National Craftsmanship Awards", "Leadership includes two past NOMMA presidents and a former railing-standards committee chairman"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1963 by Leon and Evelyn York -> /about", "Family-owned and operated -> /about", "Specializes in customized approach to Non-Ferrous Handrail Industry -> /about", "Custom crafting ornamental railings since 1963 -> /", "Works with Aluminum, Stainless, Bronze, Wood, Glass -> /", "Serves Architects, Designers, General Contractors, Steel Companies -> /", "No set list of rail systems or parts; build to meet design -> /", "Working with a partner to provide a full metal package -> /", "Two past Presidents of NOMMA have called YMF home -> /about", "Past Chairman/member of Standards Committee on Permanent Railing systems -> /about", "Won numerous National Craftsmanship Awards in NOMMA''s Top Job Competition -> /about", "Headquarters in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Custom crafting ornamental railings since 1963", "founded_year": "1963", "