UPDATE companies SET description='Zoila''s Sample Room Inc. operates in New York City''s Garment Center, founded in 2005 by Zoila Cruz. She launched her own sample room in 2005, building a reputation for turning sketches into finished garments.

The shop provides end‑to‑end pattern and sample development, including draping, fitting, alterations, and custom orders. It handles production runs ranging from 13 to 200 pieces and works with a broad spectrum of fabrics — knits, silk chiffon, jersey, netting, denim, wool, leather, fur, sequins, lace, and delicate materials that require extra care.

Clients include established New York labels and emerging designers from Miami, Los Angeles, Boston, Washington DC, and upstate New York. Past collaborators include Morgane Le Fay, Miguelina, Libertine, and Thakoon, while testimonials cite brands led by Jonathan Simkhai, Camilla Staerk, and others who have used the shop for runway samples, sales‑order production, and made‑to‑measure red‑carpet and wedding gowns.

The company emphasizes Cruz’s three decades of pattern‑making experience and her ability to guide designers from initial sketch to model‑ready garments, often coordinating remotely via Instagram, email, video, and phone. In 2020 the CFDA featured her in its LatinX Series, highlighting her role in bringing new designers’ visions to life.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Pattern making", "Sample making", "Draping", "Fitting", "Alterations", "Custom garment production", "Small-batch production (13-200 pieces)", "Fabric expertise (knits, silk chiffon, jersey, netting, denim, wool, leather, fur, sequins, lace, delicate fabrics)"], "industries": ["Apparel", "Fashion design", "Garment manufacturing", "Bridal wear", "Red carpet wear"], "materials": ["Knits", "Silk chiffon", "Jersey", "Netting", "Denim", "Wool", "Leather", "Fur", "Sequins", "Lace", "Delicate fabrics"], "equipment": [], "volume": "13 to 200 pieces", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 30 years of pattern and sample making experience", "Production runs from 13 to 200 pieces", "Works with delicate and specialty fabrics (silk chiffon, leather, fur, sequins, lace)", "Remote collaboration via Instagram, email, video, and phone", "Featured in CFDA LatinX Series 2020"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2005 in NYC Garment Center by Zoila Cruz -> /about", "Zoila Cruz worked for Morgane Le Fay, Miguelina, Libertine, Thakoon -> /about", "Over 30 years experience in pattern & sample making -> /services", "Production volume 13 to 200 pieces -> /", "Services: pattern making, sample making, draping, fitting, alterations, custom orders -> /, /services", "Fabrics: knits, silk chiffon, jersey, netting, denim, wool, leather, fur, sequins, lace, delicate fabrics -> /services", "Clients: emerging designers from Miami, LA, Boston, DC, upstate NY -> /about", "Testimonials from Gloria Lee, Jonathan Simkhai, Camilla Staerk, Fisayo Quadri, Teo Griscom, HILA -> /, /about", "CFDA LatinX Series feat