UPDATE companies SET description='hg medical USA operates as the U.S. subsidiary of hg medical GmbH, headquartered in Holland, Michigan, with a production facility in Huntington, West Virginia. The company was established after Wright Medical acquired the DARCO implant division, and later became majority-owned by Nord Holding.

The company manufactures orthopedic implants for bone surgery, processing approved raw materials such as titanium, stainless steel, and PEEK on modern machining centers at its sites in Raisting, Germany, and Huntington, West Virginia. Its U.S. facility has added automated milling capabilities. Both locations run independent quality management systems certified to ISO 13485 and comply with FDA 21 CFR Part 820, having undergone full FDA audits.

hg medical serves original equipment manufacturers in the orthopedic market, ranging from global market leaders to emerging startups. Its implants are used in bone surgery procedures worldwide, and the company emphasizes traceability and regulatory compliance for medical device OEMs.

The company states that its differentiator lies in operating completely independent, ISO 13485-certified quality systems at each production site, combined with full FDA audit experience and a commitment to using only approved materials. Management describes its standard as "Best in Class" and invites customer audits to demonstrate quality firsthand.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016','ISO 13485:2021','FDA 21 CFR Part 820']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC machining", "Milling", "Turning", "Orthopedic implant manufacturing", "Quality management systems (ISO 13485)", "FDA 21 CFR Part 820 compliance", "Traceability", "Material processing (titanium, stainless steel, PEEK)"], "industries": ["Orthopedic implants", "Medical devices", "Bone surgery", "OEM medical device manufacturers"], "materials": ["Titanium", "Stainless Steel", "PEEK"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Independent ISO 13485-certified quality systems at each production site", "Full FDA 21 CFR Part 820 compliance with completed FDA audits", "Exclusive use of approved raw materials: titanium, stainless steel, PEEK", "Automated milling operations at U.S. facility"], "facts_used": ["Manufactures orthopedic implants for bone surgery -> /", "Production sites in Raisting (Germany) and Huntington, West Virginia (USA) -> /", "Materials: titanium, stainless steel, PEEK -> /", "ISO 13485:2016 and ISO 13485:2021 certifications -> /quality", "FDA 21 CFR Part 820 compliance and full FDA audits -> /quality", "Independent quality management systems at each site -> /quality", "Automated milling in USA -> /", "Headquarters in Holland, Michigan -> db", "Majority-owned by Nord Holding -> industries_served (news item)", "Founded after Wright Medical acquired DARCO implant division -> products (history)", "Serves global market leaders and startups -> /", "Languages: German and English -> /, /quality"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evi