UPDATE companies SET description='ZDC Tech is based in Lexington, Kentucky. The company traces its roots to 2011 when Advanced Semiconductor Processing Technology (ASPT) was established to commercialize a novel humidity sensor invented by Dr. David Chen, a professor of electrical engineering at the University of Kentucky. ZDC Tech continues that research and development lineage today.

The company designs and manufactures dew point transmitters (models E80 and E100) and portable dew point meters, all built on its patented hybrid dielectric sensor platform produced with nanotechnology methods. It also operates a dew point sensor calibration service.

ZDC Tech serves industrial customers needing humidity and dew point measurement, though specific sectors are not named in its public materials.

