) and PLC programming -> /", "Serves mining (coal, stone, salt) and food/beverage industries -> /about", "Multifunction power center circuit tester used by MSHA and DEP -> /about", "Offers turn-key electrical substation installations and breaker testing -> /about", "Customer support with telephone troubleshooting -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We manufacture and rebuild power distribution centers for the mining industry", "founded_year": "1998", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='a-c-power-tech-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='À La Carte Foods Properties, LLC operates from Belle Rose, Louisiana, where it was founded in 1987. The company began as a custom food manufacturer and product designer, focusing on authentic Louisiana cuisine.

The company provides custom food manufacturing, private labeling, co-packing, research and development, and nutritional analysis. Its USDA- and FDA-certified facility, completed in 2001, follows HACCP and SQF guidelines and employs over 50 workers. The plant handles soups, sauces, bases, and other prepared foods, with approximately two-thirds of output produced under client labels.

Primary customers are food-service operators, including restaurants and national distributors such as Sysco and U.S. Foods, as well as regional distributors. The company also sells branded products directly to consumers through retail pickup and nationwide shipping. A long-standing client, The Cajun Turkey Co., has sourced products for over 24 years.

